[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Too Late]
[00:01.64]Did the detectives save the diamonds? | 侦探们保住钻石了吗？
[00:13.10]The plane was late and detectives were waiting at the airport all morning. | 飞机晚点了，侦探们在机场等了一上午。
[00:19.87]They were expecting a valuable parcel of diamonds from South Africa. | 他们正在等一个从南非寄来的贵重钻石包裹。
[00:25.57]A few hours earlier, | 几个小时前，
[00:28.00]someone had told the police that | 有人告诉警方，
[00:30.42]thieves would try to steal the diamonds. | 小偷会设法偷走这些钻石。
[00:33.78]When the plane arrived, | 飞机抵达时，
[00:36.14]some of the detectives were waiting | 一些侦探在
[00:38.54]inside the main building | 主楼里等候，
[00:40.62]while others were waiting on the airfield. | 另一些则在机场跑道上等候。
[00:44.41]Two men took the parcel off the plane | 两名男子把包裹从飞机上卸下来，
[00:47.98]and carried it into the Customs House. | 并把它搬进了海关。
[00:51.22]While two detectives were keeping guard at the door, | 两名侦探在门口守卫，
[00:55.69]two others opened the parcel. | 另外两名打开了包裹。
[00:58.58]To their surprise, | 令他们吃惊的是，
[01:00.69]the precious parcel was full of stones and sand! | 这个贵重包裹里装满了石头和沙子！